  360: 	    D1/D2 prove the COUNTER consumer does not; nothing pinned the RATE consumer to
  361: 	    prescaling, which is the round's headline design decision.  100 MHz / (1000 * 256)
  362: 	    is 390.625 Hz; the mutant asks for 100000, a rate 256x too fast.  */
